{"name":"Oh Em Ghee","hex":"#e3c81c","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"ghee","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A type of clarified butter used in South Asian cooking.","Vegetable oil for cooking."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/ghee"}],"entries":[{"title":"Ghee","blocks":[{"text":"Ghee is a type of clarified butter, originating in the Indian Subcontinent. It is a widely used butter for cooking especially in Indian cuisines and in Hindu religious rituals. Typically made from cow butter or buffalo butter, ghee is favoured for its nutty flavour and high smoke point allowing it to be heated at high temperatures without burning."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ghee","wikidata":"Q323225"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9c/Cream_to_get_clarified_butter_home_made.Ghee.jpg/500px-Cream_to_get_clarified_butter_home_made.Ghee.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9c/Cream_to_get_clarified_butter_home_made.Ghee.jpg/1280px-Cream_to_get_clarified_butter_home_made.Ghee.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9c/Cream_to_get_clarified_butter_home_made.Ghee.jpg/500px-Cream_to_get_clarified_butter_home_made.Ghee.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"In the cream butter method, cream is separated from milk and churned to produce butter. The butter then undergoes heat clarification.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACream_to_get_clarified_butter_home_made.Ghee.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/74/Food_Fair_%282025%29_11.jpg/500px-Food_Fair_%282025%29_11.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/74/Food_Fair_%282